{:edb/db-before-t 2200 :edb/db-after-t 2201 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535513 50 #inst "2026-10-09T01:35:53.362Z" 13194139535513 true] [17592186096750 1020 #edb/ref 17592186353036 13194139535513 true] [17592186096750 1020 #edb/ref 17592186353043 13194139535513 true] [17592186096751 1020 #edb/ref 17592186353022 13194139535513 true] [17592186096751 1020 #edb/ref 17592186353029 13194139535513 true] [17592186096752 1020 #edb/ref 17592186353040 13194139535513 true] [17592186353022 1017 #edb/ref 17592186353023 13194139535513 true] [17592186353022 1089 "q-10564" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353022 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535513 true] [17592186353022 1100 "Calculate $\\int (2-\\frac{x}{2}+2{cot}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353022 1113 #uuid "a1b26c3b-96b0-52d3-9e98-7e02650b6e2d" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353022 1145 "In this case, we have to use the identity  $1+{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x.$ Rearranging this gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cot}^{2}⁡x & ={csc}^{2}⁡x-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (2-\\frac{x}{2}+2{cot}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (2-\\frac{x}{2}+2({csc}^{2}⁡x-1))\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2-\\frac{x}{2}+2{csc}^{2}⁡x-2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (-\\frac{x}{2}+2{csc}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353023 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353024 13194139535513 true] [17592186353023 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353025 13194139535513 true] [17592186353023 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353026 13194139535513 true] [17592186353023 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353027 13194139535513 true] [17592186353023 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353028 13194139535513 true] [17592186353023 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535513 true] [17592186353023 1041 "selection" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353023 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353025 13194139535513 true] [17592186353023 1110 #uuid "e6d87b6a-2d8d-5f42-b424-21c45ef8dfa4" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353024 1034 "-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353024 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353024 1111 #uuid "d37483d0-54e8-56db-8cf8-399d748e4c93" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353025 1034 "-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353025 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353025 1111 #uuid "8a92530f-fd1b-503d-abf8-85b1f00d8ad4" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353026 1034 "\\frac{x}{4}-2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353026 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353026 1111 #uuid "585c146e-b9a2-529b-8cca-56ef10f4d4e6" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353027 1034 "-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353027 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353027 1111 #uuid "c4a61483-3df0-514b-a9dd-0f74ccbddf3f" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353028 1034 "\\frac{x}{2}-2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353028 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353028 1111 #uuid "26f06fbf-1b3a-5651-b948-1bed46033232" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353029 1017 #edb/ref 17592186353030 13194139535513 true] [17592186353029 1089 "q-114460" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353029 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535513 true] [17592186353029 1100 "Evaluate ${\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}({sin}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x{sin}^{3}⁡x)\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353029 1113 #uuid "f13ef730-2951-5e5c-80ec-1865f954d1d9" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353029 1145 "In this case, we have to use the identity  $1+{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x.$ \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}({sin}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x{sin}^{3}⁡x)\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}{sin}^{3}⁡x(1+{cot}^{2}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}{sin}^{3}⁡x{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}{sin}^{3}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /3} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353030 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353031 13194139535513 true] [17592186353030 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353032 13194139535513 true] [17592186353030 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353033 13194139535513 true] [17592186353030 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353034 13194139535513 true] [17592186353030 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353035 13194139535513 true] [17592186353030 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535513 true] [17592186353030 1041 "selection" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353030 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353032 13194139535513 true] [17592186353030 1110 #uuid "bc3f3e3a-a469-510d-8cd3-e49689d40298" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353031 1034 "2\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353031 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353031 1111 #uuid "bc8913f3-7c76-5780-9a88-76683c3658d2" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353032 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{2}" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353032 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353032 1111 #uuid "ea7b310b-1192-584f-bf9e-354366ac057d" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353033 1034 "3\\sqrt{2}-1" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353033 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353033 1111 #uuid "314135c6-8c28-5843-ac94-2e9ba7313bf3" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353034 1034 "1" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353034 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353034 1111 #uuid "77f2b83f-f92e-5e4a-b0d1-fd992e8ec06d" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353035 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-1}{3}" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353035 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353035 1111 #uuid "fbcb3a13-a994-5b70-b311-95aaf043c414" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353036 1017 #edb/ref 17592186353037 13194139535513 true] [17592186353036 1089 "q-352671" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353036 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535513 true] [17592186353036 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{6(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353036 1113 #uuid "0899606b-48d4-500a-9606-9745cf9c9ef3" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353036 1145 "We use the secant-tangent identity:\n\n$$\n{tan}^{2}⁡x+1={sec}^{2}⁡x\\,⟹\\,{sec}^{2}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x=1\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we compute the given integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{6(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{6(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot (\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{6({sec}^{2}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x)}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{6\\cdot 1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{6}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =6[\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{tan}⁡(0)] \\\\  & =6(1-0) \\\\  & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353037 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353038 13194139535513 true] [17592186353037 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353039 13194139535513 true] [17592186353037 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535513 true] [17592186353037 1041 "field-1" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353037 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353038 13194139535513 true] [17592186353037 1110 #uuid "ed501d06-2884-5539-8dfc-2dc73caea2e0" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353038 1034 "6" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353038 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353038 1111 #uuid "3d19df34-5268-5aa7-91b1-72e6f1aa2e1a" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353039 1034 "0" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353039 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353039 1111 #uuid "3c1a18fa-5c09-5132-95a1-54715b01e4fc" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353040 1017 #edb/ref 17592186353041 13194139535513 true] [17592186353040 1089 "q-362813" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353040 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535513 true] [17592186353040 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{1}[3{x}^{2}{csc}^{2}⁡(3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})-3{x}^{2}{cot}^{2}⁡(3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})]\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353040 1113 #uuid "5f22d656-7f8b-5701-b453-1c7fe0b91d9a" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353040 1145 "From the identity ${csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta =1$ with $\\theta =3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4},$ we get \n\n$$\n{csc}^{2}⁡(3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})-{cot}^{2}⁡(3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})=1.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}[3{x}^{2}{csc}^{2}⁡(3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})-3{x}^{2}{cot}^{2}⁡(3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})]\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}3{x}^{2}[{csc}^{2}⁡(3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})-{cot}^{2}⁡(3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}3{x}^{2}(1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}3{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={x}^{3}\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & ={1}^{3}-{0}^{3} \\\\  & =1-0 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353041 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353042 13194139535513 true] [17592186353041 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535513 true] [17592186353041 1041 "field-1" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353041 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353042 13194139535513 true] [17592186353041 1110 #uuid "fbb8ab33-80a7-571c-a805-9daaa00fee00" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353042 1034 "1" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353042 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535513 true] [17592186353042 1111 #uuid "57fc5c32-2622-50d7-a787-547f6a2be4be" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353043 1017 #edb/ref 17592186353044 13194139535513 true] [17592186353043 1089 "q-73525" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353043 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535513 true] [17592186353043 1100 "Evaluate ${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}({x}^{2}{sec}^{2}⁡x-{x}^{2}{tan}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353043 1113 #uuid "6c3bd164-cd8f-542d-8dad-087dc9d87ca2" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353043 1145 "First, we select the identity that contains a ${tan}^{2}⁡x$ term. So we can use the identity \n\n$$\n{tan}^{2}⁡x+1={sec}^{2}⁡x\\,⟹\\,{sec}^{2}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x=1.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we compute the given integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}({x}^{2}{sec}^{2}⁡x-{x}^{2}{tan}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{x}^{2}({sec}^{2}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[{(\\frac{\\pi }{4})}^{3}-{0}^{3}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{{\\pi }^{3}}{64} \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{3}}{192}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353044 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353045 13194139535513 true] [17592186353044 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353046 13194139535513 true] [17592186353044 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353047 13194139535513 true] [17592186353044 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353048 13194139535513 true] [17592186353044 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353049 13194139535513 true] [17592186353044 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535513 true] [17592186353044 1041 "selection" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353044 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353045 13194139535513 true] [17592186353044 1110 #uuid "8e33d844-99c2-59fc-be9d-037dc920bfe2" 13194139535513 true] [17592186353045 1034 "\\frac{{\\pi }^{3}}{192}" 13194139535513 true] [175